"The next wave of innovation is pointing toward even deeper personalization "
"and sustainability. Imagine a home that not only knows when to turn off "
"lights but adjusts your heating, monitors air quality, tracks your energy "
"usage, and suggests optimizations. As sensors become more sophisticated and "
"data becomes more actionable, homes are getting smarter, and greener."
